[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":93},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","v26i039z6izfp7e3crhsdvn7m","revision",1,"title","作者观点：库存采购规模与亚马逊营收增长的关系","originalTitle","If you spend $10,000 a month on inventory, your sales will stay locked at $25,000 to $30,000 a month.","summary","作者在帖子中提出个人观点：若每月库存支出为10,000美元，销售额可能停留在每月25,000至30,000美元；他认为，如果月度采购预算长期不变，营收就容易停滞，并建议希望收入翻倍的卖家先扩大月度采购量。上述金额对应关系与增长效果均为作者个人经验性主张，原文未提供数据、样本或可核验来源，本站尚未独立核验，不能作为经营决策依据。","reason","source",{"_9":86,"_87":88,"_89":90,"_91":39,"_92":-5},"links",{"_83":84,"_66":85},"publishedAt","2026-10-07T18:00:35.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T16:14:18.256Z","timelineAt","category","fba","tags",[80,81,82],"score",22,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","askjimmysmith","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>If you spend $10,000 a month on inventory, your sales will stay locked at $25,000 to $30,000 a month.</p><p>A lot of sellers wonder why their revenue hits a plateau, but their monthly buy budget has not changed in six months. You cannot scale an Amazon business without scaling how much inventory you purchase and send to FBA.</p><p>If you want revenue to double, your monthly purchase volume has to scale first.</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Jimmy Smith","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[],"FBA/物流","库存管理","亚马逊","aihot","/items/v26i039z6izfp7e3crhsdvn7m","https://x.com/askjimmysmith/status/2107893868146418006","x-jimmy-smith","name","X · Jimmy Smith","kind","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_94":95},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
